webForCore-thirdparty
https://github.com/xforcore/webForCore-thirdparty

Components
----------

WebActivatorEx (src/WebActivatorEx)
  webForCore's own implementation of WebActivatorEx 2.x's public API (PreApplicationStartMethodAttribute,
  PostApplicationStartMethodAttribute, ApplicationShutdownMethodAttribute, ActivationManager), written from its
  documentation and behaviour. MIT License, Copyright (c) webForCore contributors. Moved from
  xforcore/webForCore (src/WebFormsForCore.WebActivatorEx, PR #24).
  It is not WebActivatorEx's code. It uses WebActivatorEx's assembly name, version (2.0.0.0) and public key (token
  7b26dc2a43f6a0d4, in WebActivatorEx.public.snk) so that assemblies built against WebActivatorEx bind to it; it is
  delay signed with that public key and is not signed by WebActivatorEx's author. WebActivatorEx is David Ebbo's
  project (https://github.com/davidebbo/WebActivator, Apache License 2.0).

AjaxControlToolkit (external/WebFormsForCore.AjaxControlToolkit, built by the projects in src/AjaxControlToolkit:
AjaxControlToolkit, AjaxControlToolkit.StaticResources, AjaxControlToolkit.HtmlEditor.Sanitizer)
  The AJAX Control Toolkit 20.1 (https://github.com/DevExpress/AjaxControlToolkit, through
  https://github.com/simonegli8/WebFormsForCore.AjaxControlToolkit commit 0c5b111, with WebFormsForCore's and
  webForCore's changes for .NET). The source is a submodule of
  https://github.com/xforcore/WebFormsForCore.AjaxControlToolkit, branch webforcore-thirdparty: that commit, cleared
  down to the three projects' files; any change to the toolkit's code is a commit on that branch. Moved from xforcore/webForCore (src/WebFormsForCore.AjaxControlToolkit); only the
  three shipped projects were moved. BSD 3-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2012-2020, CodePlex Foundation (see
  LICENSE-BSD-3-CLAUSE.txt and the submodule's LICENSE.txt). Signed with the toolkit's published key
  (AjaxKey.snk). The packages depend on HtmlAgilityPack (MIT), Antlr3.Runtime (BSD) and Newtonsoft.Json (MIT) from
  nuget.org.

AutoMapperLegacy (src/AutoMapperLegacy, tests/AutoMapperLegacy.Tests)
  A source-compatible facade for AutoMapper 3.x and 4.x's static API on AutoMapper 12-14. MIT License, Copyright (c)
  webForCore contributors. Its API follows AutoMapper 3.3.1's and 4.2.1's, and ValueResolver<,>, TypeConverter<,>,
  IValueResolver, ResolutionResult and IgnoreMapAttribute are adapted from AutoMapper 3.3.1.
  tests/AutoMapperLegacy.Tests/AutoMapper3 is AutoMapper 3.3.1's unit tests (src/UnitTests), ported; each file says
  where it came from. AutoMapper (https://github.com/LuckyPennySoftware/AutoMapper, tags v3.3.1 and v4.2.1) is under
